    "detailed_description": "<h1>BECOME A CREW MEMBER</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SINUS is an action-platformer RPG set in a cyberpunk universe. Explore different planets with every run, find new and playable crew members with their own backstories, traits and abilities. Capture any enemy you encounter and equip them to fight for you. Hack control panels to access powerful turrets and even put a twist on death. Find a multitude of items and upgradable weapons. Combine them with unique skills to create your build and match your play style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/0779ba795cbb78249724e7830284fb45.poster.avif?t=1752494439\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/0779ba795cbb78249724e7830284fb45.webm?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/0779ba795cbb78249724e7830284fb45.mp4?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/e9b92b0c2d568d11a56fe32df1cd6a73.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HACK </strong>Control Panels to virtualize and control powerful turrets or regenerate from death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HACK </strong>Enemies to equip and give them commands. Evolve them to stronger versions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HACK </strong>Upgrade Stations to increase your weapon\u2019s elemental power, strategy, or upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HACK </strong>Signal Centers to reveal new locations and progress.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/2864d0b73887b2c306794690b5ccf2ef.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/3684a04134dd9c055364ebbd6ed6637d.poster.avif?t=1752494439\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/3684a04134dd9c055364ebbd6ed6637d.webm?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/3684a04134dd9c055364ebbd6ed6637d.mp4?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an endless supply of powerful and upgradable weapons, tailored to any playstyle. Items are procedurally generated making every playthrough unique. Create synergies between them to unlock your true potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/db70dd6bda370e074b177292391b666a.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/b8f5eb5dec0f6b0d6d92b59357de0fd9.poster.avif?t=1752494439\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/b8f5eb5dec0f6b0d6d92b59357de0fd9.webm?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/b8f5eb5dec0f6b0d6d92b59357de0fd9.mp4?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a universe with infinite replayability through procedurally generated levels. Conquer cities filled with enemies, traps and exploding barrels at every turn. Discover hidden secrets that offer helpful loot, or an entire new zone to explore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/54f0123b596269f9ee9e93cdf7576544.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/e0bd5aa09504a07dae73d480edbb035a.poster.avif?t=1752494439\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/e0bd5aa09504a07dae73d480edbb035a.webm?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/e0bd5aa09504a07dae73d480edbb035a.mp4?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling adventure and assemble your dream team with each playthrough. Choose a different character to kick off your journey, and scout out talented crew members with different traits and abilities. Every member of your crew is a playable character! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/d9e0a4eebcfd865f78987338d5eaf10c.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the console in your ship to unlock new items or permanent upgrades to boost your fighting chances in the next run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/517e7067f02a8138b5916d9334a6317d.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends in an intense local multiplayer experience with Deathmatch and Teams game modes. All the hacking mechanics are here, including control panels, regeneration, and weapon upgrading, so you can bet there will be some competitive and clutch moments.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/ba7da913eadd942ef6ee0769ec658499.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fluid player movement and twin-stick shooting, with unlockable special moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Millions of fierce weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture any enemy to fight for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of powerfull turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite replayability through procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple playable characters with different traits and abilities to suit any playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interesting skills that add new mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of optional routes for extra loot or upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings based on your personal progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meta-progression through the ship console to increase your chances in the next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A multitude of secrets</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SINUS is an action-platformer RPG set in a cyberpunk universe. Explore different planets with every run, find new and playable crew members with their own backstories, traits and abilities. Capture any enemy you encounter and equip them to fight for you. Hack control panels to access powerful turrets and even put a twist on death. Find a multitude of items and upgradable weapons. Combine them with unique skills to create your build and match your play style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/0779ba795cbb78249724e7830284fb45.poster.avif?t=1752494439\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/0779ba795cbb78249724e7830284fb45.webm?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/0779ba795cbb78249724e7830284fb45.mp4?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/e9b92b0c2d568d11a56fe32df1cd6a73.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HACK </strong>Control Panels to virtualize and control powerful turrets or regenerate from death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HACK </strong>Enemies to equip and give them commands. Evolve them to stronger versions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HACK </strong>Upgrade Stations to increase your weapon\u2019s elemental power, strategy, or upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HACK </strong>Signal Centers to reveal new locations and progress.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/2864d0b73887b2c306794690b5ccf2ef.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/3684a04134dd9c055364ebbd6ed6637d.poster.avif?t=1752494439\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/3684a04134dd9c055364ebbd6ed6637d.webm?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/3684a04134dd9c055364ebbd6ed6637d.mp4?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an endless supply of powerful and upgradable weapons, tailored to any playstyle. Items are procedurally generated making every playthrough unique. Create synergies between them to unlock your true potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/db70dd6bda370e074b177292391b666a.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/b8f5eb5dec0f6b0d6d92b59357de0fd9.poster.avif?t=1752494439\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/b8f5eb5dec0f6b0d6d92b59357de0fd9.webm?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/b8f5eb5dec0f6b0d6d92b59357de0fd9.mp4?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a universe with infinite replayability through procedurally generated levels. Conquer cities filled with enemies, traps and exploding barrels at every turn. Discover hidden secrets that offer helpful loot, or an entire new zone to explore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/54f0123b596269f9ee9e93cdf7576544.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/e0bd5aa09504a07dae73d480edbb035a.poster.avif?t=1752494439\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/e0bd5aa09504a07dae73d480edbb035a.webm?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/e0bd5aa09504a07dae73d480edbb035a.mp4?t=1752494439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling adventure and assemble your dream team with each playthrough. Choose a different character to kick off your journey, and scout out talented crew members with different traits and abilities. Every member of your crew is a playable character! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/d9e0a4eebcfd865f78987338d5eaf10c.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the console in your ship to unlock new items or permanent upgrades to boost your fighting chances in the next run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/517e7067f02a8138b5916d9334a6317d.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends in an intense local multiplayer experience with Deathmatch and Teams game modes. All the hacking mechanics are here, including control panels, regeneration, and weapon upgrading, so you can bet there will be some competitive and clutch moments.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/ba7da913eadd942ef6ee0769ec658499.webp?t=1752494439\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fluid player movement and twin-stick shooting, with unlockable special moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Millions of fierce weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture any enemy to fight for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of powerfull turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite replayability through procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple playable characters with different traits and abilities to suit any playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interesting skills that add new mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of optional routes for extra loot or upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings based on your personal progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meta-progression through the ship console to increase your chances in the next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A multitude of secrets</p></li></ul>",
